cleanup-el-lora-f16.gguf, cleanup-sq-lora-f16.gguf, cleanup-en-lora-f16.gguf
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Gemma is provided under and subject to the Gemma Terms of Use found at ai.google.dev/gemma/terms

These LoRA adapters for Qwen3-1.7B were trained on the same training data as Cleanup-v2-q4_0.gguf, so everything
said above for Cleanup-v2-q4_0.gguf applies to them in the same way: the Apache License 2.0 and the Gemma Terms of
Use, including the use restrictions and the duty to pass them and this notice on. Modification notice: these are
not Gemma models and contain no Gemma weights. They are LoRA weights (rank 16) for Qwen3-1.7B, converted to GGUF
with llama.cpp.

