qwen3-1.7b-q4_0.gguf
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The unmodified Qwen3-1.7B (Qwen team, Alibaba Cloud; Apache License 2.0, see LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt), converted to
GGUF and quantized to Q4_0 with llama.cpp (format conversion and quantization only; the tied output weight is stored
once). It was not trained on any of our data, and no Gemma terms apply to this file.

