Greek-main_el.dict
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Greek-main_el.dict includes word forms from the Greek wordlist main_el2 of Helium314/aosp-dictionaries
(codeberg.org/Helium314/aosp-dictionaries), which is derived from dim-geo/greekdictionary
(github.com/dim-geo/greekdictionary) and licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0. The dictionary is
therefore distributed under GPL-3.0 (LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt). Its corresponding source is the text wordlist
Greek-main_el.combined, published next to it, together with the build script in training/dictionary/.

